sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Reviewer
  participant S as Settings panel
  participant T as Token state
  participant L as localStorage
  participant C as GitHub client
  participant G as GitHub
  R->>S: Paste PAT, Connect
  S->>T: setGithubToken(token)
  T->>T: Clear repo, file and PR state
  T->>L: setItem mardoc_github_token
  T->>C: initOctokit(token)
  C->>G: REST and GraphQL with token
  Note over T,L: Next page load
  L-->>T: getItem restores token
  T->>C: initOctokit(saved token)
  R->>S: Disconnect
  S->>T: setGithubToken(null)
  T->>C: resetGitHubSession
  T->>L: remove token and repo keys
